  description: '3 "Hecahands" monsters

    If this card battles a monster, neither
    can be destroyed by that battle. You can only use each of the following effects
    of "Hecahands Xeno" once per turn. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You
    can look at 2 random face-down cards in your opponent''s Extra Deck, then you
    can Special Summon 1 of them to your field. If this Fusion Summoned card you
    own and control is destroyed by your opponent''s card effect: You can take control
    of any number of monsters your opponent controls.'
